{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "628e5aaa937c827dbc5b9b8f40d39773e7d8e8b30788559ab5f50388d9a11b9c", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　カワイイ茜ちゃんが\n増えたらどう思う！？　うれしい？　うれしいよね！", "zh": "{$P$}！要是可爱的小茜\n变多了，你怎么看！？会高兴吗？肯定很高兴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6d1ca8bda02ed181a02fd458e5e29f94c95207b3387c5d8cdf2e8bf0d0c0ff0c", "ja": "そうだな。いや、でも増えたらって……あ！\nもしかして、この間撮影した忍者の話か？", "zh": "这样啊。不过，要是增加了……啊！  \n难道说，你指的是前段时间拍摄的忍者那件事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "01aeb763d45472ba85a69e72b6e2e15c7dd467b0a051bf832eb6b41a6e616b87", "ja": "そうそう、分身くのいち茜ちゃん！　いいよね～……\nたくさん増やせば、代わりにレッスンも……ぬふふっ♪", "zh": "对对，分身女忍者小茜！很不错吧～……\n要是多变出几个来，连练习也能让她们代替……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "59c0167cb7c029bf674b8a9c807403c2d4c2d9b98456eafbe806ceac246bc351", "ja": "どうやって分身しようかな～？　ここはやっぱり、\n等身大茜ちゃん人形を作って……！", "zh": "要怎么分身呢～？这时候果然还是要做一个等身大的小茜人偶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2e885baac79bdc2a823fb5c7b2d1cad926521371a93571cbd80b875e45f3b548", "ja": "それは変わり身の術じゃ……。\nでもいいのか？　本当に増えたら茜が困ると思うけど。", "zh": "那不叫分身术……。\n不过，真的没问题吗？要是真的变多了，我觉得茜会很困扰吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "da59665a476c5aaf1e6e8c0352377689aa4aa63b995d782b9b4b422bce81d5f8", "ja": "へ？　なんで？　カワイイ茜ちゃんが増えるなんて\n全人類共通の夢じゃないの！？", "zh": "诶？为什么？可爱的小茜能变多，这不是全人类共同的梦想吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1006_p", "source_sha256": "52a2c85b607486ac88b836bff162423e633471fd498a5107fb2f463ac3bb4a1a", "ja": "じゃあ茜に問題だ。冷蔵庫にさっき買ってきたプリンが\n一個だけ入っている。もし茜が何人もいたら……？", "zh": "那就给茜出道题。冰箱里放着刚才买来的布丁，只有一个。要是有好几个茜的话……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "35d192cc42dafa8edacb3e6d1a31916006077060ecef500368041d05fb5169c6", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、それは……分身した茜ちゃんたちが\nプリンを巡って、大プリン戦争を始めちゃう……！", "zh": "啊！？那、那就是……分身后的小茜们为了布丁，开始一场大布丁战争……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0342_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "8f1ba4e184d99d6e4e604ccf0c2e15ddfbf21301f251633ae31e134af669c7eb", "ja": "よし、茜ちゃん分身計画は中止です！\nだから……冷蔵庫のプリンは茜ちゃんがもらうね♪", "zh": "好，小茜分身计划取消！所以……冰箱里的布丁就归小茜啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
